; What the Khronos OpenCL loader calls to read a vendor's registration
; (feature 052). Its registry path opens the adapter's software key through
; cfgmgr32 and reads OpenCLDriverName here.
LIBRARY advapi32.dll
EXPORTS
GetSidSubAuthority
GetSidSubAuthorityCount
GetTokenInformation
OpenProcessToken
RegCloseKey
RegEnumValueA
RegOpenKeyExA
RegQueryValueExA
